

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:2
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_ed66347d:

    # "The barracks were built into the north-eastern wall of the fort."
    "Los barracones se construyeron en la muralla noreste del fuerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:3
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_2c7f6a1f:

    # "Cold, moist air welcomed us into what seemed to be our living quarters from now on."
    "El aire frío y húmedo nos dio la bienvenida a lo que parecía que iba a ser nuestra vivienda a partir de ahora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:4
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_3722f164:

    # "Recruits were trying on their new armor. Some just sat on their bunks, concerned."
    "Los reclutas se probaban sus nuevas armaduras. Algunos se sentaban en sus literas, preocupados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:5
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_361bb228:

    # "As I was circling a particularly big guy adjusting straps on his armor, I found myself standing beside two empty bunks."
    "Mientras rodeaba a un tipo especialmente grande ajustando las correas de su armadura, me encontré al lado de dos literas vacías."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:6
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_adffd1b9:

    # "I turned to face Markus."
    "Me giré para mirar a Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:9
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_33d0a905:

    # MC "I guess these are as good as any."
    MC "Supongo que estas son tan buenas como cualquiera."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:10
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_8c386ccb:

    # MARKUS "You seriously think we get to pick?"
    MARKUS "¿De verdad crees que podemos elegir?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:11
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_875938d3:

    # MC "Well, I don't see any of them ordering us around."
    MC "Bueno, no veo a ninguno de ellos dándonos órdenes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:12
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_8095938a:

    # "With that, I waved towards a couple of guards at the far end of the room."
    "Dicho esto, hice un gesto con la mano hacia un par de guardias situados en el otro extremo de la sala."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:13
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_53f458a8:

    # "Markus nodded."
    "Markus asintió."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:14
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_73fd8781:

    # MARKUS "Fair enough."
    MARKUS "Está bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:16
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_834c6edf:

    # "Wooden trunks Joakim mentioned were set beside each bed."
    "Los baúles de madera que mencionó Joakim estaban colocados junto a cada cama."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:17
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_f6bc5929:

    # "I opened mine and was greeted by predatory glint of a halfway-sheathed sword."
    "Abrí la mía y fui recibido por el brillo depredador de una espada a medio envainar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:18
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_10c49309:

    # "Beneath it was a rather heavy set of leather armor."
    "Debajo había una pesada armadura de cuero."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:29
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_39e0278a:

    # "A short while later..."
    "Poco después..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:37
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_c757ea9d:

    # "Markus stretched about and flexed his arms as I was fitting the sheath onto my belt."
    "Markus se estiró y flexionó los brazos mientras yo me colocaba la vaina en el cinturón."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:38
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_790ea3fc:

    # MARKUS "It's very tight in my... private area."
    MARKUS "Está muy apretado en mi... área privada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:39
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_d01f552c:

    # MC "Mine's okay."
    MC "El mío está bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:40
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_92f0967b:

    # MARKUS "Exactly."
    MARKUS "Exacto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:41
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_5a4a2f7e:

    # MC "Go to h~"
    MC "Vete a~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:42
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_82d486b0:

    # GUARD "Recruits!"
    GUARD "¡Reclutas!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:44
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_454e72d0:

    # "One of the guards shouted in a commanding tone, ceasing all activity in the barracks."
    "Uno de los guardias gritó en tono de mando, cesando toda actividad en los barracones."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:44
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_5cb164df:

    # GUARD "Get strapped and head out into the yard now! This is not a fashion contest!"
    GUARD "¡Abrochaos el cinturón y salid al patio ya! Esto no es un concurso de moda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:47
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_eda86dd2:

    # "I adjusted my sheath belt and nodded to Markus."
    "Me ajusté el cinturón y asentí a Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:48
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_fc84574c:

    # MARKUS "Mission complete, I guess."
    MARKUS "Misión cumplida, supongo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:50
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_bcc804a7:

    # "We headed out to the yard along with other recruits."
    "Nos dirigimos al patio junto con otros reclutas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:51
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_EnterBarracksToGetGear_32fab128:

    # "Being no more but a crowd of armed civilians, we now looked like we belonged to a single military unit, for what its worth."
    "Al no ser más que una multitud de civiles armados, ahora parecíamos pertenecer a una única unidad militar, por lo que pudiera parecer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:62
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_45d8f227:

    # "Out on the yard the recruits gathered, talking and examining each other."
    "Los reclutas se reunieron en el patio, hablando y examinándose unos a otros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:63
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_1e31f202:

    # "I noticed that redhead from before walking past us."
    "Me fijé en la pelirroja de antes que pasó junto a nosotros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:65
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_cc6c0c9a:

    # KIARA @ happy "Looking good, boys!"
    KIARA @ happy "¡Se os ve bien, chicos!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:66
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_c91ac63e:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Yeah, you too, young lady!"
    MARKUS @ smile "¡Sí, tú también, señorita!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:67
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_33bad0b1:

    # "As she passed us, I stole another glance at that leather-clad beauty and asked Markus:"
    "Mientras pasaba a nuestro lado, eché otro vistazo a aquella belleza vestida de cuero y le pregunté a Markus:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:69
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_30f15ad3:

    # MC "How's that private area of yours doing now, huh?"
    MC "¿Cómo va ahora esa zona privada tuya, eh?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:70
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_111c74c8:

    # MARKUS "You have no idea..."
    MARKUS "No tienes ni idea..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:78
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5dfda96d:

    # "Suddenly, the doors flung open and a short man with a grey beard stormed through them."
    "De repente, las puertas se abrieron de golpe y un hombre bajo con barba gris irrumpió tras ellas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:79
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_8e289369:

    # "Stocky, he carried with him heavy armour covered in scratches and dirt that clanked with every movement."
    "Fornido, llevaba consigo una pesada armadura cubierta de arañazos y suciedad que tintineaba con cada movimiento."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:80
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0dc6b792:

    # "More impressive was the monumental axe slung over his back that looked sharp enough to cut glass and the edges of which were traced with enchanted blue lines, eerily incandescent."
    "Más impresionante era el hacha monumental que llevaba a la espalda, tan afilada como para cortar vidrio y cuyos bordes estaban trazados con líneas azules encantadas, inquietantemente incandescentes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:81
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_31b98a0f:

    # "He vaulted forward onto the wooden podium Joakim lectured us from and landed with surprising grace, wood creaking under his heavy boots."
    "Saltó hacia delante sobre el podio de madera desde el que Joakim nos sermoneaba y aterrizó con sorprendente gracia, la madera crujiendo bajo sus pesadas botas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:82
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_24a5c132:

    # "He glowered down at us as he scanned the crowd from right to left."
    "Nos miró con severidad mientras recorría la multitud de derecha a izquierda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:83
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_afebb2e4:

    # "We fell into an ominous silence as we waited for what he would say."
    "Nos sumimos en un inquietante silencio a la espera de lo que dijera."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:84
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b9d9c4d5:

    # "Finally, with a heavy sigh, he began:"
    "Finalmente, con un fuerte suspiro, comenzó:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:86
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_1bf2dc79:

    # DUPREY "I am Captain Duprey, leader of the Second Scouts Division."
    DUPREY "Soy el capitán Duprey, líder de la segunda ivisión de exploradores."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:87
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0156ee5b:

    # DUPREY "It is a great honour to be called upon to serve with the Scouts. I trust that you understand what has been bestowed upon you."
    DUPREY "Es un gran honor ser llamado a servir con los exploradores. Confío en que comprendáis lo que se os ha concedido."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:88
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_48443525:

    # DUPREY "Many of you are pissing yourselves right now and probably have been since you found out you were joining these corps."
    DUPREY "Muchos de vosotros os estáis meando encima ahora mismo y probablemente lo hayáis hecho desde que os enterasteis de que os uníais a estos cuerpos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:89
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6eecb82f:

    # DUPREY "You have probably spent these last few years learning all the proper terms, the fancy tactics and no doubt some very pretty footwork as a part of the basic combat training you all had received."
    DUPREY "Es probable que hayáis pasado los últimos años aprendiendo todos los términos adecuados, las tácticas elegantes y, sin duda, un juego de piernas muy bonito como parte de la formación básica de combate que todos habéis recibido."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:90
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6e19fe3e:

    # DUPREY "We are going to work you {i}hard{/i} to forget all that!"
    DUPREY "¡Vamos a trabajar {i}duro{/i} para que olvidéis todo eso!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:91
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_077f216b:

    # CROWD "{i}*Confused murmurs*{/i}"
    CROWD "{i}*Murmullos confusos*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:93
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_03077b09:

    # DUPREY "I am not interested in you showing me your majestic flying three-sixty spinning limp dicked thrust!"
    DUPREY "¡No estoy interesado en que me muestres tu majestuoso giro volador de tres sesenta empuje de polla flácida!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:94
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_ecac7050:

    # DUPREY "You will learn practical things here. You will learn how to be dirty in the fight to level the field against {i}the Demorai{/i}."
    DUPREY "Aquí aprenderéis cosas prácticas. Aprenderéis a ser sucios en la lucha para equilibrar el campo contra {i}los demorai{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:95
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_e9df6359:

    # DUPREY "You will learn how to kill, without mercy and without hesitation."
    DUPREY "Aprenderéis a matar, sin piedad y sin vacilar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:96
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_45026bd0:

    # DUPREY "You will learn {i}to win.{/i}"
    DUPREY "Aprenderéis {i}a ganar.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:97
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_3d3a4c07:

    # "One of the men stepped forward nervously to raise his hand."
    "Uno de los hombres se adelantó nerviosamente levantando la mano."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:98
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_d3da28fb:

    # RECRUIT "A-Aren’t we supposed to fight honourably though?"
    RECRUIT "¿N-no se supone que debemos luchar honorablemente?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:100
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_75f8880f:

    # DUPREY "... Come here."
    DUPREY "... Ven aquí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:101
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_995efa62:

    # "The man looked around, unsure of what to do."
    "El hombre miró a su alrededor, inseguro de qué hacer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:104
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_f3e4c30d:

    # DUPREY "I SAID COME HERE!"
    DUPREY "¡HE DICHO QUE VENGAS AQUÍ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:105
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_9e1355c7:

    # "Some of the guards moved to shove the man out of the line, where he climbed hesitantly onto the stage with the Captain."
    "Algunos de los guardias empujaron al hombre fuera de la fila, donde subió vacilante al escenario con el capitán."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:110
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_ffbf2113:

    # "Y-Yes, sir?"
    "¿S-sí, señor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:111
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_8ac93488:

    # "Taking a small sword, the Captain threw it to the man’s feet."
    "Cogiendo una pequeña espada, el capitán la arrojó a los pies del hombre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:112
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_d682f5d8:

    # DUPREY "Strike me down."
    DUPREY "Golpéame."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:113
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_15291902:

    # "The crowd was silent, the man looked at him bewildered."
    "La multitud guardó silencio, el hombre le miró desconcertado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:114
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_967048d4:

    # RECRUIT "W-What?"
    RECRUIT "¿Q-qué?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:116
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_0fca85b6:

    # DUPREY "Pick that sword up and strike me down, boy! That is an order."
    DUPREY "¡Levanta esa espada y golpéame, muchacho! Es una orden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:116
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_3ce74784:

    # RECRUIT "... But I—"
    RECRUIT "... Pero yo—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:120
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_30606e01:

    # DUPREY "YOU FUCKING MAGGOT!"
    DUPREY "¡MALDITO GUSANO!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:121
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_635fa0f5:

    # DUPREY "DO AS YOU’RE TOLD OR I’LL FLAY YOU MYSELF AND HANG YOUR BODY FROM THE WALLS AS A WARNING TO ANYONE ELSE THAT CAN’T FOLLOW SIMPLE FUCKING ORDERS."
    DUPREY "HAZ LO QUE TE DIGO O TE DESPELLEJARÉ YO MISMO Y COLGARÉ TU CUERPO DE LAS PAREDES COMO ADVERTENCIA PARA CUALQUIERA QUE NO PUEDA SEGUIR UNAS SIMPLES PUTAS ÓRDENES."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:122
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_84e18a54:

    # "Terrified, the man scurried to pick up the sword, trembling as he pointed it towards the Captain."
    "Aterrorizado, el hombre se apresuró a coger la espada, temblando mientras la apuntaba hacia el capitán."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:123
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_c22cf657:

    # DUPREY "... Now, STRIKE ME!"
    DUPREY "... ¡Ahora, GOLPÉAME!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:134
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5b9f4532:

    # "The man cried out as he lunged forward to attack the Captain."
    "El hombre gritó mientras se lanzaba hacia delante para atacar al capitán."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:135
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_2ce3e37e:

    # "Side stepping the blade, the Captain locked in the man’s arms and the two wrestled vehemently over the sword."
    "Apartándose de la hoja, el capitán se aferró a los brazos del hombre y ambos forcejearon con vehemencia por la espada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:147
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b7d5ce0d:

    # "So fast it was almost a blur, the Captain shoved his head forward, violently headbutting the unsuspecting man."
    "Tan rápido que fue casi un espejismo, el capitán empujó la cabeza hacia delante, propinando un violento cabezazo al desprevenido hombre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:148
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_b0a3df0b:

    # "His nose ruptured open; blood streamed down his face so forcefully that when he screamed it spattered over Duprey."
    "Se rompió la nariz; la sangre le corrió por la cara con tanta fuerza que cuando gritó salpicó a Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:148
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_9cb326ef:

    # RECRUIT "You... You broke my nose!"
    RECRUIT "Me... ¡Me rompiste la nariz!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:150
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_5b4bc1f3:

    # DUPREY "MEDIC! Get this man to the ward."
    DUPREY "¡MÉDICO! Lleven a este hombre a la enfermería."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:152
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_ReturnToYard_6cac3d25:

    # "As a small team of people hurried over to drag the now delirious man through some black steel gates, the Captain casually continued his speech."
    "Mientras un pequeño equipo de personas se apresuraba a arrastrar al hombre, ahora delirante, a través de unas puertas de acero negro, el capitán continuó su discurso con despreocupación."

