    DUPREY "¡Reclutas, atención!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:195
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_2ea90ceb:

    # DUPREY "Let's see what we're working with here!"
    DUPREY "¡Veamos con qué estamos trabajando!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:196
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_e93c1e63:

    # "Duprey glared at us, evaluating the raw material he was about to begin his work on."
    "Duprey nos miró fijamente, evaluando la materia prima con la que iba a empezar a trabajar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:197
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_31a8afcf:

    # DUPREY "For starters, give me twenty laps along these walls."
    DUPREY "Para empezar, necesito veinte vueltas a lo largo de estas paredes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:199
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_7ba801cb:

    # "The next few hours were a flurry of footwork and drill manoeuvres."
    "Las horas siguientes fueron un torbellino de maniobras y ejercicios."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:200
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_01d01bfe:

