    DUPREY "... ¡EMPIEZA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:264
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_725c57b7:

    # "We watched as the Captain lunged forward aggressively with the spear."
    "Observamos cómo el capitán se lanzaba agresivamente hacia delante con la lanza."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:266
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_143afabf:

    # "Much to everyone’s surprise, the girl did far better than expected."
    "Para sorpresa de todos, la chica lo hizo mucho mejor de lo esperado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:267
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_1960f074:

    # "She deflected each blow parried her way and at one point even managed to kick the Captain back with her foot."
    "Desvió todos los golpes y, en un momento dado, incluso consiguió patear al capitán con el pie."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:271
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_62b6d361:

    # "The possibility that she might win hung tentatively in the air..."
    "La posibilidad de que ganara flotaba tímidamente en el aire..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:272
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_af36f2ed:

    # "At the last moment, she managed to deflect another one of the Captain’s blows before swinging for him with what would have been a deathblow."
    "En el último momento, logró desviar otro de los golpes del capitán antes de lanzarse a por él con lo que habría sido un golpe mortal."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:275
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_11ef0394:

    # "Before she could make it though, the Captain reached out his hand and, to everyone’s shock, a bolt of energy blasted the girl so brutally that the wood beneath her splintered as she hit the floor."
    "Sin embargo, antes de que pudiera hacerlo, el capitán extendió la mano y, para sorpresa de todos, un rayo de energía alcanzó a la chica de forma tan brutal que la madera que había bajo ella se astilló mientras caía al suelo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:281
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_fcddbd23:

    # "As he brushed himself off, the girl looked up at the Captain, dazed and confused."
    "Mientras se limpiaba, la chica miró al capitán, aturdida y confusa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:282
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_91988c05:

    # KIARA @ scared "But... {i}how?{/i}"
    KIARA @ scared "Pero... {i}¿Cómo?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:283
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_9fcae072:

    # KIARA @ scared "There’s no magic circle! How did you—"
    KIARA @ scared "¡No hay círculo mágico! ¿Cómo es que—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:284
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_5bcc6cd8:

    # DUPREY "A good attempt, girl. You almost had me there."
    DUPREY "Un buen intento, chica. Casi me tienes ahí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:285
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_f0504735:

    # "The Captain held out a hand, helping her back to her feet."
    "El capitán le tendió una mano para ayudarla a ponerse en pie."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:286
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_b6aec33c:

    # "As he pulled her up, he leaned in to whisper something in her ear and his lips curled upwards into a small smile."
    "Mientras tiraba de ella hacia arriba, se inclinó para susurrarle algo al oído y sus labios se curvaron hacia arriba en una pequeña sonrisa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:287
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_b8ee3afa:

    # KIARA @ scared "I don’t understand though... That kind of magic..."
    KIARA @ scared "Aunque no lo entiendo... Ese tipo de magia..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:288
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c1f1362c:

    # "The Captain smirked as he kicked some of the hay aside and revealed a magic circle concealed beneath."
    "El capitán sonrió satisfecho mientras apartaba parte del heno y dejaba al descubierto un círculo mágico oculto bajo él."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:289
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_a51105ae:

    # "The crowd murmured, half in awe, half in surprise."
    "La multitud murmuraba, medio asombrada, medio sorprendida."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:290
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_efda234b:

    # DUPREY "Like I said, girl, here, we don’t teach the fancy stuff."
    DUPREY "Como he dicho, chica, aquí no enseñamos esas cosas elegantes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:291
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c762f908:

    # DUPREY "We teach you how to win. No matter what."
    DUPREY "Te enseñamos a ganar. Pase lo que pase."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:292
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c59322b4:

    # "The crowd applauded and cheered as the girl smiled sheepishly."
    "El público aplaudió y vitoreó mientras la chica sonreía tímidamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:294
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05014119:

    # "When she got off the podium, she was welcomed back by the others who all patted her on the back for a fight well fought."
    "Cuando bajó del podio, fue recibida de nuevo por los demás, que le dieron palmaditas en la espalda por una lucha bien librada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:297
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_3e8845e2:

    # DUPREY "Alright everyone!"
    DUPREY "¡Muy bien, todo el mundo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:298
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_53cb2fa8:

    # DUPREY "It's a start alright, but we still have a lot of work ahead of us!"
    DUPREY "Es un buen comienzo, pero aún nos queda mucho trabajo por delante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:299
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05bea46f:

    # DUPREY "Now, go and take some rest."
    DUPREY "Ahora, iros a descansar un poco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:301
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_df74a53c:

    # DUPREY "By the time the sun hits these training dummies, I expect you lot here again!"
    DUPREY "Para cuando el sol llegue a estos muñecos de entrenamiento, ¡os espero aquí de nuevo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:302
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "¡Rompan filas!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:326
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_0bd9b2e5:

    # DUPREY "It stands to reason, you maggots."
    DUPREY "Es lógico, gusanos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:327
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_c6b5eac0:

    # DUPREY "That to {i}kill{/i} the enemy, you must first strike him."
    DUPREY "Que para {i}matar{/i} al enemigo, primero hay que golpearlo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:328
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_75af9096:

    # DUPREY "You cannot hesitate with your blade, not even for a second."
    DUPREY "No puedes dudar con tu espada, ni siquiera un segundo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:329
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_56b25b16:

    # DUPREY "The Demorai will spare you no quarter."
    DUPREY "Los Demorai no os darán cuartel."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:330
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_94c5eb63:

    # DUPREY "They know no fear."
    DUPREY "No conocen el miedo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:331
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_87825edf:

    # DUPREY "Hesitation does not exist in the minds of the enemy you will face."
    DUPREY "La vacilación no existe en la mente del enemigo al que te enfrentarás."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:332
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_2ae3da65:

    # DUPREY "They will not stop, they will keep coming until {i}you{/i} are dead."
    DUPREY "No se detendrán, seguirán viniendo hasta que {i}estés{/i} muerto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:333
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_a1a19941:

    # DUPREY "...So {i}you{/i} will not stop, {i}you{/i} will know no hesitation either."
    DUPREY "...Así {i}vosotros{/i} no os detendréis, {i}vosotros{/i} tampoco conoceréis la vacilación."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:334
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_9ef65af9:

    # DUPREY "{i}You{/i} will make them kiss the blades you carry and grant them the death they so crave!"
    DUPREY "¡{i}Vosotros{/i} les haréis besar las espadas que lleváis y les concederéis la muerte que tanto ansían!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:335
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_931fd1a0:

    # "There was some cheering, whistles and claps from the recruits, but Captain Duprey remained stoically the same."
    "Hubo algunos vítores, silbidos y aplausos de los reclutas, pero el capitán Duprey permaneció estoicamente igual."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:336
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_3c541189:

    # DUPREY "When you strike at an enemy, if you're too slow they may dodge or block the strike."
    DUPREY "Cuando golpeas a un enemigo, si eres demasiado lento puede esquivar o bloquear el golpe."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:337
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_935e6dba:

    # DUPREY "Get used to that feeling of metal clashing, you lose your blade out in the field, {i}you're finished.{/i}"
    DUPREY "Acostumbraos a esa sensación de metal chocando, si perdéis la espada en el campo, {i}estáis acabados.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:338
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_bba80207:

    # DUPREY "Now grab someone to spar with."
    DUPREY "Ahora buscad a alguien con quien entrenar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:339
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...¡COMENZAD!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:359
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7a71149d:

    # MARKUS "That was... good."
    MARKUS "Eso estuvo... bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:360
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b31d8f4f:

    # "Markus caught his breath and asked:"
    "Markus recuperó el aliento y preguntó:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:361
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_34c43e8a:

    # MARKUS "Say, wanna go again?"
    MARKUS "Dime, ¿quieres ir otra vez?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:336
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_5d179d76:

    # MARKUS "You could do better, [player_name!t]."
    MARKUS "Podrías hacerlo mejor, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:364
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_732df93f:

    # "Markus looked around and figured we could go for another round."
    "Markus miró a su alrededor y pensó que podríamos hacer otra ronda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:365
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_6c053eec:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again, shall we?"
    MARKUS "Vamos otra vez, ¿de acuerdo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:341
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b09806db:

    # MARKUS "That's my [player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "¡Ese es mi [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:369
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_c9b50785:

    # MARKUS "Let's learn to handle these sticks of ours proper..."
    MARKUS "Aprendamos a manejar bien estos palos..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:370
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f9bd7eb4:

    # MC "Sticks of ours? Wha~"
    MC "¿Palos? ¿Qu~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:371
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_982720f4:

    # MARKUS "Defend yourself!"
    MARKUS "¡Defiéndete!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:375
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_73fd8781:

    # MARKUS "Fair enough."
    MARKUS "Está bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:381
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_85180b52:

    # "We have spent the remainder of the day practicing more basic combat moves."
    "Pasamos el resto del día practicando movimientos de combate más básicos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:383
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_950ca5f4:

    # "Exhausted, I made my way back towards the barracks."
    "Agotado, volví hacia los barracones."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:388
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b623e6ef:

    # "Entering the barracks, I was whistled over by a towering warrior I have seen a couple times before in the fort."
    "Al entrar en los barracones, me silbó un imponente guerrero que ya había visto un par de veces en el fuerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:365
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_6adb8189:

    # OFFICER @ talk "[player_name!t], isn't it?"
    OFFICER @ talk "[player_name!t], ¿verdad?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:393
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_942cd646:

    # MC @ talk "Yes sir."
    MC @ talk "Sí, señor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:395
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_9493a3e8:

    # OFFICER @ talk "I am First Officer Borras, Captain Duprey's second in command."
    OFFICER @ talk "Soy el primer oficial Borras, segundo al mando del capitán Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:395
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f902ebfc:

    # "I gulped as my body straightened and stiffened on its own."
    "Tragué saliva mientras mi cuerpo se enderezaba y se ponía rígido por sí solo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:396
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b1f42af4:

    # MC @ talk "S-sir?"
    MC @ talk "¿S-Señor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:397
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3936d95e:

    # BORRAS @ talk "You're on cleaning duty tonight."
    BORRAS @ talk "Esta noche te toca limpiar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:399
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_8629b4ea:

    # MC @ talk "(Arrgh! Come on now!)"
    MC @ talk "(¡Arrgh! ¡Venga ya!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:401
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_9a2d9435:

    # MC @ talk "...Yes sir."
    MC @ talk "...Sí, señor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:404
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f4f3ec57:

    # "I spent the next hour or so mopping, polishing and cleaning the barracks from top to bottom."
    "Pasé la hora siguiente fregando, abrillantando y limpiando los barracones de arriba abajo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:406
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_00514271:

    # "Finally, I found myself finished."
    "Finalmente, acabé."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:407
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a4f1e169:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC "{i}*Suspiro*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:408
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_278d91ab:

    # MC "(All that's left to do is clean the wash area.)"
    MC "(Solo queda limpiar la zona de los lavabos)."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:409
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_57878b2a:

    # "As I headed in, I heard what sounded like... splashing?"
    "Al entrar, oí lo que sonaba como... ¿salpicaduras?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:410
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_68fec10d:

    # "At this hour?"
    "¿A estas horas?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:411
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_554aa8aa:

    # "Realizing the splashing was coming from the woman's side, I pondered what to do..."
    "Al darme cuenta de que el chapoteo venía del lado de las mujeres, me planteé qué hacer..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:416
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3b428651:

    # "It had felt like forever since I last got the chance to see a woman naked."
    "Me parecía una eternidad desde la última vez que tuve la oportunidad de ver a una mujer desnuda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:417
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_bfd776ce:

    # "The temptation was too much to bear, and, letting my curiosity get the best of me, I peeked around the woman's side to take a look."
    "La tentación fue demasiado fuerte y, dejándome llevar por la curiosidad, me asomé al lado de las mujeres para echar un vistazo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:419
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_adf06afd:

    # "Kiara was squatted down naked, washing herself with a wet flannel and bucket."
    "Kiara estaba desnuda en cuclillas, lavándose con un paño y un cubo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:420
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a4806da6:

    # KIARA "So, are you just going to stand there and watch?"
    KIARA "Entonces, ¿te vas a quedar ahí mirando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:421
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3d654567:

    # MC @ scared "K-Kiara!"
    MC @ scared "¡K-Kiara!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:422
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2df5f315:

    # "Realizing I'd been caught, Kiara, grabbing a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "Al darme cuenta de que me habían pillado, Kiara cogió una toalla y se la envolvió mientras avanzaba hacia mí con los brazos cruzados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:423
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a50ae3ab:

    # MC @ scared "It... It isn't what it looked like?"
    MC @ scared "No... ¿No es lo que parece?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:425
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_1ca6c786:

    # "That scout girl I've seen around was squatted down naked, washing herself with a wet flannel and bucket."
    "Esa chica exploradora que he visto por ahí estaba en cuclillas desnuda, lavándose con un paño y un cubo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:426
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_edca490d:

    # KIARA "Kiara. Pleasure meeting you."
    KIARA "Kiara. Un placer conocerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:430
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2bbabbd5:

    # MC @ scared "Wh-what..."
    MC @ scared "¿Qu-qué?..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:431
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_04b16aef:

    # "As I realized I was caught, I shot words at her in an apologetic burst:"
    "Al darme cuenta de que me habían pillado, le solté unas palabras en un arrebato de disculpa:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:406
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3e3db114:

    # MC "[player_name!t], pleasure's all mine, I'm sorry I was~"
    MC "[player_name!t], el placer es todo mío, siento haber~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:433
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_478fa33b:

    # "Kiara grabbed a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "Kiara cogió una toalla y se la envolvió mientras se acercaba a mí con los brazos cruzados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:440
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_cfb43425:

    # KIARA @ angry "So you {i}weren't{/i} just spying on me then?"
    KIARA @ angry "¿Entonces {i}no{/i} me estabas espiando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:441
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_77f8c828:

    # MC "N-No, I came here to clean the wash rooms, I swear it so!"
    MC "N-no, he venido a limpiar los lavabos, ¡lo juro!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:442
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_d56beb53:

    # "Kiara's stern expression softened as she laughed."
    "La expresión severa de Kiara se suavizó mientras reía."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:443
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_812bd8c8:

    # KIARA @ happy "Haha, relax."
    KIARA @ happy "Jaja, relájate."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:444
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_800b5920:

    # KIARA "I'm just playing with you."
    KIARA "Solo estoy jugando contigo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:445
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_4eb41718:

    # "Kiara winked."
    "Kiara guiñó un ojo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:446
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_1365d248:

    # KIARA "You can take a look anytime you want, cutie."
    KIARA "Puedes echar un vistazo cuando quieras, guapo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:447
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7ebb922b:

    # MC "I - {i}*Cough*{/i}"
    MC "Yo - {i}*Toser*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:448
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_80e56fde:

    # MC @ talk "What are you doing here?"
    MC @ talk "¿Qué estás haciendo aquí?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:449
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7ac5c305:

    # KIARA "Some guard fell sick, so I got pulled to do some evening patrol duty."
    KIARA "Un guardia se puso enfermo, así que me llamaron para patrullar por el anochecer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:450
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_98dca5a4:

    # KIARA "I decided to clean myself up before I went back to my bed."
    KIARA "Decidí limpiarme antes de volver a la cama."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:451
translate es qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_292e532e:

    # MC "I - I see..."
    MC "Ya - ya veo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:452
